Package: soundfile-termux
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: termux-learn-crypto <vilasrmeshram400@gmail.com>
Depends: python, python-pip, python-numpy, libsndfile, libffi, clang, make, pkg-config
Section: python
Priority: optional
Description: SoundFile for Termux - read/write audio files (wav, flac, ogg)
 apt installs libsndfile; the install step pip-installs cffi + soundfile
 and patches soundfile to find libsndfile on Android (sys.platform
 'android' on Python 3.13+). Commands: soundfile-setup, soundfile-check.
